# ExITS SaaS — root repository ignore rules
# Temporary Phase 0 model: portfolio docs are tracked; HealthCare/ stays nested and ignored.
# Do not remove HealthCare/ from this file until an approved repository-integration work package.

# Nested HealthCare product repository at repo root only (independent Git during Phase 0+).
# Leading slash prevents ignoring Platform paths such as Application/Integration/HealthCare/.
/HealthCare/

# Secrets and local environment
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!.env.example

# .NET / build outputs
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
**/artifacts/
**/coverage/
**/CoverageResults/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# IDE / editor
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
*.DotSettings.user

# Local databases and certificates
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
!**/certs/*.example.pem

# Database backup artifacts (never commit dumps or encrypted production backups)
*.dump
*.dump.enc
**/ops/backup/local/
**/ops/backup/*.manifest.json

# OS / misc
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.log
